WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.413
Next, which cloud.

2
00:00:01.413 --> 00:00:04.990
Every call in this chapter is
on the stable Graph version,

3
00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:07.501
except protected actions, which is beta.

4
00:00:07.501 --> 00:00:13.143
For this estate's GCC tenant the host is
the worldwide Graph endpoint, and every

5
00:00:13.143 --> 00:00:18.700
method used lists the global service that
G C C uses in its availability table.

6
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:22.067
The code never assumes a
cloud: you name it explicitly,

7
00:00:22.067 --> 00:00:24.430
and there's no default to fall back on.
